WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
But look at the map, northern Maine is empty,

2
00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:04.440
so I'm not surprised if it has no name.

3
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.200
But we're glad to have you, and God bless you.

4
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.040
If you're here for the first time, my sister,

5
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.160
God bless you as well.

6
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:13.680
This drawer keeps coming out and pushing against me.

7
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.120
For those of you online, wherever you are,

8
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.320
thank you again for connecting with us.

9
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:19.680
We're delighted to have you.

10
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.840
We see you with the eye of faith.

11
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.160
We really do.

12
00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:28.000
Before I jump into the message, as always,

13
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.800
if you're not using one of these, turn them off completely.

14
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.680
If you are using them, turn the volume all the way down.

15
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.240
Faith number two.

16
00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.000
While I'm speaking, pray for me and say,

17
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.120
Lord, put your words in that man's mouth.

18
00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.760
Jeremiah chapter one, verse nine,

19
00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:50.920
then the Lord put forth his hand and touched my mouth.

20
00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.280
And the Lord said unto me,

21
00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:56.560
behold, I have put my words in thy mouth.

22
00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:00.000
I think of the words God spoke to Moses in Exodus four.
